  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LC045 now reports a navigation read inside a private method in the same file that is handed the entity and only reads navigations on it — the shape real code uses, where 5.7.48 covered only local functions. A private method cannot be overridden and the same-tree requirement keeps the semantic model free. Anything callable from outside the type, a callee that loads, and one that passes the entity on all stay escapes.",
